'''Burke's Trailing''',<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" /> also known as '''Burke's Trail''',<ref name="Encyclopedia">{{EncyclopediaCite|Kashyyyk and Other Planets in the Mid Rim}}</ref> was a [[hyperspace]] [[Hyperspace route|trade route]] that the former [[pirate]] [[Queen]] [[Maz Kanata]] marked on a map as one of the "real" trade routes for [[smuggler]]s to use, rather than the official ones, in the [[book]] that would eventually become known as the ''[[Smuggler's Guide]]''. One end of the route began with the [[Ponemah Terminal]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]], which the route then passed through the [[Expansion Region]] and [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]] to connect with the [[planet]] [[Jakku]] in the [[Inner Rim Territories|Inner Rim]]. It then passed back out to [[Adrathorpe system|Adrathorpe]] in the Expansion Region, then on to the [[moon]] [[Jedha]] in the Mid Rim before terminating at [[Ord Mantell]].<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

==Behind the scenes==
Burke's Trailing was first mentioned in the [[2018]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: Smuggler's Guide]]'', which was written by [[Daniel Wallace]].<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

